==Restrictions==
Max # of Deployable Cats: 2

==Battleground==
*2 [[St. Pigge the 2nd]]s spawn after 33.33 seconds<sup>1,000f</sup>, delay 33.33 seconds<sup>1,000f</sup>.
*3 [[Doge Dark]]s spawn after 16.67 seconds<sup>500f</sup>, delay 33.33 seconds<sup>1,000f</sup>.
*1 [[Assassin Bear]] spawns after 900 seconds<sup>27,000f</sup>.

==Strategy==
Most average damage dealing [[:Category:Anti-Dark Cats|anti-Darks]] can handle the Doge Darks. For St. Pigge the 2nd, use high damage dealers like [[Valkyrie Cat (Special Cat)|Holy Valkyrie Cat]] or [[Bahamut Cat (Special Cat)|Crazed Bahamut Cat]]. Use any strong anti-reds (i.e. [[Sushi Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Sushi Cat]]) if you have them. High damage dealers can sweep this stage with ease while using your meatshields to stall the Doge Darks.

